			SYNTAX DisplayString
			MAX-ACCESS read-write
			STATUS current
			DESCRIPTION
				"
				
				Values:
				Pacific/Tongatapu
				Pacific/Fiji
				Pacific/Auckland
				Asia/Magadan
				Asia/Vladivostok
				Australia/Hobart
				Pacific/Guam
				Australia/Sydney
				Australia/Brisbane
